<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋπλόκᾰμ-ος</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋπλ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with goodly locks, fair-haired</i>, epith. of goddesses
			and women, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, etc., esp. of Eos and Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.390
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				20.80
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				B.
				3.34
			</span></i>, etc.; later also of boys and men, <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				439
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. κόμαι</span>
			<i>goodly</i> tresses, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				790
			</span></i> (lyr.): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋπλοκάμου πολιῆς ἁλός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.131
			</span></i>; of the tentacles of polypi, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.182
			</span></i>.</div>
